          "value": "\n<ol><li>\n<p>From the poor one </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>\u02bfAli\u0304 Efendi, </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>commander </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>of the Janissaries (Mustah\u0323fiz\u0323a\u0304n) </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>of Damietta </p>\n</li></ol>\n\n",
